Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:11.98,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:18.42,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:24.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:31.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:48.01,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.85,0:00:54.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:01:00.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:07.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:13.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:24.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法动弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:44.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论用跑的用冲的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都不可能摆脱我的风的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:56.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要逃的话只有趁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:07.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的结界变松散的现在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:10.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是只怕奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是那男人的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该拥有能切断 我与奈落之间障碍的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:30.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.78,0:02:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还“嗨”咧 你不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫作风使神乐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.75,0:02:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴 你还记得我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.12,0:02:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手先放开剑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是来找你打架的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸 要不要和我交易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交易？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:57.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是什么 你应该知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些四魂碎片 我可以给你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件是…把奈落杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我从那家伙的身边解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第67话 狂乱飞舞的背叛之风
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:24.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以你的力量绝对能办到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:25.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能得到他收集到的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.95,0:03:34.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要使用它 不就能随心所欲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是你背叛了奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我本来就不是心甘情愿服从那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.96,0:03:46.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不觉得跟我联手不会吃亏吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不巧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对什么四魂之玉没有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要自由的话
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.11,0:03:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己利用那碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死奈落不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕奈落吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:06.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 我没有义务协助你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.09,0:04:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有独自一人下手的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么最好不要想背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样还算是男子汉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:20.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看错人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的想找杀生丸少爷做后盾吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该说她不知天高地厚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有自知之明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.29,0:04:43.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只是个奈落的分身罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷好强呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不需要什么四魂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风使神乐…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.03,0:04:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底能不能 自己用碎片的力量打倒奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不管结果怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都与我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷 要出发了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 忘了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然小玲现在不是一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人是不是一个人太孤单了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:31.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚晚餐您想吃什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:44.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.35,0:05:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是绑得太紧了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:48.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:50.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你亲手包扎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就不觉得痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个死了无所谓的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.86,0:05:54.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用管他 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.73,0:05:57.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不痛的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:05:59.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快点滚回巢穴去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是一副 不堪一击的人类模样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然还夸口想要跟我打
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又不是喜欢变成这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:14.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要打吗 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:16.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.95,0:06:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不想去取回四魂碎片吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你也跟着一起走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 那是我的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能够给你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 神乐并没有回到城里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.20,0:06:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎离奈落城的结界愈来愈远了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.41,0:06:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:53.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是依照奈落的指示行动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.49,0:06:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐拿着碎片逃走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:58.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是不可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你不觉得奇怪吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界的事情也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你和钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:08.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能闻得到城的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.87,0:07:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为结界变弱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不就是代表现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖力衰退了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.17,0:07:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖力衰退了…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.04,0:07:20.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这仿佛就像是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 奈落也是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由人类鬼蜘蛛做维系
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汇集了众多妖怪而成的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是半妖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.02,0:07:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像犬夜叉在朔日会丧失妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:39.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定奈落 也有妖力衰退的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:43.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是奈落也有弱点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:20.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:23.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃也没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个只动嘴的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样随便乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:37.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没有独自一人下手的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么最好不要想背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然要我自己使用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后杀了奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了…是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们的照顾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:08:59.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.71,0:09:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙 伤势不要紧了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.85,0:09:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经痊愈了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个废物不同
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.09,0:09:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:10.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁是废物啊 浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.99,0:09:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去四魂碎片的钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.23,0:09:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想报仇只是自投罗网
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:18.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.13,0:09:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 把犬夜叉放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:28.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你暂时安份的待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.74,0:09:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.51,0:09:32.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要冲动 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.65,0:09:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:45.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子奈落有所行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:48.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是犬夜叉的姿态被他看到就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.91,0:10:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从我这抢走的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:09.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你找犬夜叉他们帮忙的原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没了这个 你就怕到不敢一个人应战吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.69,0:10:21.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐由我来对付
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.43,0:10:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了我还有狼爪跟獠牙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:31.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:48.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光闪躲就很吃力 无法靠近她
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可没有闲功夫跟你耗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:11.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很烦耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:19.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要自由的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.35,0:11:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己利用那碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死奈落不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.50,0:11:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.00,0:11:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样根本不能跟她打嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:47.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都只会以量取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.90,0:12:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落还没有发现吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想要背叛他的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是说…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想将我收拾掉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.31,0:12:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么呆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.70,0:12:41.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙这家伙根本就不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.83,0:12:43.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是放着不管他会被杀的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:48.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 这次不要再阻止我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想去帮助钢牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到四魂碎片的味道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:56.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是钢牙被杀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就这样结束的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又会让神乐跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能袖手旁观呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.35,0:13:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 不行啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下来啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:12.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:19.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天亮了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉能变回半妖了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:26.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 万一在那之前他的样子被看到的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连只是普通的人类的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都一直战斗到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.98,0:13:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们相信自己的力量不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我绝不能退缩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还不死心啊 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你解脱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.39,0:14:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:49.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欺负那胆小狼有什么好玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始我当你的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.73,0:14:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该没有看错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.23,0:14:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然只是一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才犬夜叉的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:07.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会已经被神乐看到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类的模样了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉这家伙是白痴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然以那副模样冲出来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是再迟一步的话 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会被神乐的风贯穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.01,0:15:39.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:41.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道犬夜叉是为了救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:44.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱着半妖的秘密被发觉的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.88,0:15:45.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才跑来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 昨晚月亮没有出现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:55.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在朔日会失去妖力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.13,0:15:57.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.76,0:15:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我变回来不就得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实怎样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你现在就要死在这了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.77,0:16:10.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙蛇之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.78,0:16:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！居然能劈开我的龙卷风
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:24.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.66,0:16:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没办法躲开…我完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.58,0:16:53.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的妖怪群
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:16:59.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挡了下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.56,0:17:05.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐这家伙又溜走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.53,0:17:08.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 瘦皮狼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下你该学到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该插手我和奈落的战斗了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了 我的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.01,0:17:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.65,0:17:25.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁要给你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要忘了 大烂狗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落是我的同伴的仇人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对要比你先
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摘下奈落的脑袋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我记住了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚你看到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.21,0:17:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于犬夜叉的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对任何人都…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.88,0:17:54.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对大烂狗变成什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.55,0:17:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点兴趣都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是他不会说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:11.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙应该不用担心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落没有发觉我的背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才会利用妖怪救了我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神无 她想去什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.72,0:19:13.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地牢的下面还有房间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.01,0:19:37.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面好玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.73,0:19:57.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是构成奈落身体的妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:19:58.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落也和犬夜叉同样是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:03.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我沉眠的期间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑出城了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐 你是我的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想再回到我的身体里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再擅作主张了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.94,0:20:41.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记着别再有第二次了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.21,0:20:45.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人还是无法逃离奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时就让你活着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:53.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我重要的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往后可麻烦了哪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:09.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然秘密被神乐知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.97,0:21:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然得靠我和珊瑚撑下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.58,0:21:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不着做无谓的操心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.88,0:21:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后还不是要靠我的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.02,0:21:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴硬而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.99,0:21:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为犬夜叉在遇到大家之前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不敢让别人看到人类的模样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很依赖大家的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁依赖你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 不用害臊喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在害臊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 害臊了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:41.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害臊了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:46.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不要太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.11,0:21:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我随时都让你依靠喔 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.55,0:21:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然总是吵吵闹闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.72,0:21:57.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是都相信着大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:02.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再害怕朔日到来的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:05.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是他变强的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊~真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.43,0:22:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 吵死了 吵死啦~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:21.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:28.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:35.05,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:41.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.00,0:22:48.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.60,0:22:55.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:23:02.34,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:09.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.32,0:23:15.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.13,0:23:22.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:29.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.58,0:23:36.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是正义的小狐狸妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.41,0:23:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这样的我居然收到挑战书
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.07,0:23:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方竟然是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.34,0:24:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个飞天满天的 雷兽一族的残存者
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.11,0:24:03.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢向我挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真…真是大胆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.92,0:24:11.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给七宝充满愤怒的挑战书
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.33,0:24:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得好好的振作了
